sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User (Browser / Postman)
  participant C as Client (React / HTTP)
  participant R as Express Router
  participant AC as Auth Controller
  participant AS as Auth Service
  participant SS as Sessions Service
  participant SC as Session Cookie Helper
  participant SR as Sessions DB (Repo)
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  Note over U,C: Login to obtain session cookie + CSRF token

  U->>C: Submit identifier + password
  C->>R: POST /api/auth/login: { identifier, password }
  R->>AC: login(req,res)
  AC->>AS: authService.login({ identifier, password })

  AS->>AS: Validate credentials (lookup + password check)
  alt Invalid credentials
    AS-->>AC: throw 401
    AC-->>C: 401 { error: "invalid credentials" }
    C-->>U: Show error
  else Valid credentials
    AS->>SS: createSession({ beekeeperId, ip, userAgent })
    SS->>SS: Generate sessionToken (opaque random)
    SS->>SS: Generate csrfToken (random hex, 32 bytes)
    SS->>SS: Compute expiresAt (now + 7 days)
    SS->>SR: insert session(session_token, csrf_token, expires_at, ...)
    SR->>DB: INSERT INTO "session" (...)
    DB-->>SR: session row
    SR-->>SS: session

    SS-->>AS: { sessionToken, csrfToken, expiresAt }
    AS-->>AC: { user, sessionToken, csrfToken, expiresAt }

    Note over AC,SC: Set-Cookie: sessionId=sessionToken
    AC->>SC: setSessionCookie(res, sessionToken)
    SC-->>C: Set-Cookie sessionId=sessionToken<br/>HttpOnly&#59; Path=/&#59; SameSite=Lax&#59; Max-Age=604800<br/>Secure (only if NODE_ENV==="production")

    AC-->>C: 200 { user, csrfToken }
    Note over C: Client stores csrfToken (memory/storage). Cookie auto-sent by browser.

    Note over U,C: State-changing requests must send cookie + csrf-token

    U->>C: Perform state-changing action (example)
    C->>R: POST /api/hives: { ... }

    Note over R: Route middleware order: requireAuth -> requireCsrf
    R->>R: requireAuth
    alt Missing sessionId cookie
      R-->>C: 401 { error: "Authentication required" }
      C-->>U: Show auth required
    else Cookie present
      R->>SR: findActiveBySessionToken(sessionToken)
      SR->>DB: SELECT ... FROM "session" WHERE session_token=$1 AND expires_at>now() AND revoked_at IS NULL
      DB-->>SR: session row or none
      SR-->>R: session

      alt Invalid or expired session
        R-->>C: 401 { error: "Invalid or expired session" }
        C-->>U: Show session expired
      else Session valid
        R->>R: requireAuth populates req.user + req.session
        R->>R: requireCsrf
        alt No session on request (defensive)
          R-->>C: 401 { error: "Authentication required" }
          C-->>U: Show auth required
        else Session present
          alt Missing or invalid x-csrf-token
            R-->>C: 403 { error: "Invalid CSRF token" }
            C-->>U: Show CSRF error
          else CSRF valid (x-csrf-token == req.session.csrfToken)
            R-->>C: 2xx Success (controller runs)
            C-->>U: Success
          end
        end
      end
    end
  end
